---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — UniqueDigit" description="Privacy policy and data protection standards for UniqueDigit visitors.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 prose text-ink">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted">Last Updated: October 2026</p>

    <p>
      At UniqueDigit (accessible from https://uniquedigit.in), your privacy is one of our main priorities. This document outlines the types of information that is collected and recorded by UniqueDigit and how we use it.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      We collect voluntary information when you subscribe to our newsletter (your email address). We also log standard non-personally identifiable diagnostic records such as browser type, referring pages, and timestamps to improve site performance.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
    <p>
      Like any other website, UniqueDigit uses cookies to optimize users' experience by customizing our web page content based on visitors' browser type and other preferences.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Advertising Partners & Third-Party Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Some of our advertising partners (such as Google AdSense) and affiliate partners (such as EarnKaro and Amazon) may use cookies and web beacons on our site. Each of these partners has their own Privacy Policy.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Consent</h2>
    <p>
      By using our website, you hereby consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its terms.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
